# View > Lattice Planes and Miller Directions: (111) planes and [110]/[001]
# arrows over a copper cell, edited in their settings windows; TiO6
# octahedra of SrTiO3 in the polyhedral style.
open docs/manual/examples/cu_fcc.cif
voronoi on
expect-voronoi 14 145.058
voronoi off
plane 1 1 1 1
plane 1 1 1 1.5
direction 1 1 0 6
direction 0 0 1 4
command lattice planes settings
command miller directions settings
reset-view
screenshot rust/target/ui/overlays.png
bulk set system cubic
bulk set spacegroup 221
bulk set a 3.905
bulk set sites Sr 0 0 0; Ti 0.5 0.5 0.5; O 0.5 0.5 0
bulk build
expect-atoms 5
view style polyhedral
polyhedra-centres Ti
expect-polyhedra 1 8
command polyhedral settings
step replicate
set counts 2 2 2
apply
expect-polyhedra 8 8
reset-view
orbit 20 10
screenshot rust/target/ui/polyhedra.png
quit
